---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout
  title="Stand Out Gang Wars & Base Rooms – Plots, Factions & Raid Guide | Stand Out Wiki"
  description="Complete guide to the Gang System in Roblox STAND OUT. Covers creating a gang (25,000 Dalas), 3rd Gang Plot, baseless 25,000 Dalas raids, Passione/Fruit Company/Vampire factions, and FSA raids."
  canonicalPath="gang-wars"
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Gang System & Wars' }]}
  schemaType="Article"
  dateModified="2026-11-26"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 text-xs font-bold mb-3 border border-rose-200">
        <span>Multiplayer Organizations</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Updated Nov 24–26, 2026</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Stand Out Gang Wars, Plots &amp; Base Guide
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Gangs in Roblox <strong>STAND OUT</strong> cost <strong>25,000 Dalas</strong> to create via the Phone Gangs app and are <strong>cross-slot</strong> across your character profiles. Band together to claim one of <strong>3 Gang Plots</strong>, choose from three distinct factions, upgrade your garage, fight in competitive Gang Wars (500–750 EXP per match), and raid rival bases.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Gang Factions -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6 mb-10">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Gang Factions &amp; Base Types</h2>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold">Update 1 Expansion</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-indigo-800 mb-2">1. Passione (Default)</h3>
          <p>
            Focuses on street dominance and PvP operations. Grants <strong>+20% Coins &amp; EXP</strong> from invasions and eliminations along with boosted drop rates, plus Passione-exclusive furniture and meeting rooms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-emerald-800 mb-2">2. Fruit Company</h3>
          <p>
            Built for agricultural moguls and Rokakaka cultivators. Provides <strong>increased crop growing speed and Rokakaka mutation speed</strong> inside the base, alongside Fruit Company exclusive rooms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-rose-800 mb-2">3. Vampire</h3>
          <p>
            Nocturnal faction headquarters featuring a <strong>Mysterious Pit and Blood Reservoir / Filler</strong> amenities for Vampire builds, plus Vampire-exclusive rooms and furniture.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Gang Plots, Facilities & Garage Upgrades -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm space-y-6 mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Gang Plots (3 Locations), Base Rooms &amp; Garage</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        With the <strong>November 24, 2026</strong> patch, Studio Umbra added a <strong>3rd Gang Plot</strong> alongside the existing plots near the Docks and Diamotch. Every gang base includes a free Garage and supports separate <em>Place</em> and <em>Edit</em> base permissions for members.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-emerald-800 mb-2">Rokakaka Greenhouse</h3>
          <p>
            Plants in gang bases grow at <strong>2x speed</strong> and Rokakaka strains grow at <strong>3x speed</strong>. You can see pot ownership in shared bases and remove others' empty pots.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-amber-800 mb-2">Garage Upgrades</h3>
          <p>
            Update 1 added <strong>Security System</strong> (locks vehicles to gang members only) and <strong>Self Destruct</strong> (detonate abandoned vehicles from the garage lift or driver seat).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-rose-800 mb-2">Combat &amp; Pilot Lock</h3>
          <p>
            You cannot enter your gang base while in combat (without an active raid), and you cannot pilot a Stand into combat while your main body hides inside a gang base.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Gang Raids & Baseless 25,000 Dalas Raid -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm space-y-5 mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Gang Raids &amp; 25,000 Dalas Baseless Raid Rule</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Rival gangs can raid each other's bases to steal stored gang bank money (<strong>Tier 1: 10%</strong>, <strong>Tier 2: 15%</strong>, <strong>Tier 3: 25%</strong>), smash pots, and steal grown plants. Starting a raid also opens the attacker's own base to counter-raids, and defending earns <strong>1.5x reputation</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-amber-950">
          <strong class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800 mb-1">Nov 23–24 Patch: 25,000 Dalas Baseless Gang Raid</strong>
          <p>
            You can now prepay <strong>25,000 Dalas</strong> upfront to launch a raid against a target gang that does not currently have an active base placed. If the raid fails, your <strong>25,000 Dalas deposit is automatically transferred into the raided player's bank</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Food Safety Agency & Anti-Teaming -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900">Food Safety Agency (FSA) Raids</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          FSA Inspectors periodically visit gang bases (or ambush night Rokakaka sales at Big Chop) to seize illegal Rokakaka crops. Resisting or asking for a warrant triggers Police and SWAT waves. Defending the raid awards <strong>2,500 Coins, 2x Arrow Parts, 1x Mysterious Fertilizer, and 1x Random Seed</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900">Gang Wars &amp; Anti-Teaming</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Gang Wars feature competitive and casual King of the Hill and Team Deathmatch modes (500–750 EXP per match; posing only charges EX while holding an active combat tag). When 2+ enemies hit the same player in rapid succession, the Anti-Teaming engine grants ~<strong>1 second of i-frames</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
